#: source/refs/additional_resources.rst:2
msgid "Additional Resources"
msgstr "附加资源"

#: source/refs/additional_resources.rst:4
msgid ""
"External tutorials, research projects, and tools for robot learning and "
"deployment."
msgstr "机器人学习与部署相关的外部教程、研究项目和工具。"

#: source/refs/additional_resources.rst:8
msgid "Sim-to-Real Resources"
msgstr "Sim-to-Real 资源"

#: source/refs/additional_resources.rst:10
msgid ""
"Examples of training policies in simulation and deploying them on robots:"
msgstr "在仿真中训练策略并部署到机器人的示例："

#: source/refs/additional_resources.rst:12
msgid ""
"`Closing the Sim-to-Real Gap: Training Spot Quadruped Locomotion with NVIDIA"
" Isaac Lab <https://developer.nvidia.com/blog/closing-the-sim-to-real-gap-"
"training-spot-quadruped-locomotion-with-nvidia-isaac-lab/>`_ is a detailed "
"guide for training a quadruped locomotion policy for the Spot Quadruped from"
" Boston Dynamics, and deploying it to the real robot."
msgstr ""
"`缩小仿真与现实之间的差距: 使用 NVIDIA Isaac Lab 训练 Spot 四足机器人运动 "
"<https://developer.nvidia.com/blog/closing-the-sim-to-real-gap-training-"
"spot-quadruped-locomotion-with-nvidia-isaac-lab/>`_ 是一个详细的指南，用于为波士顿动力公司的 "
"Spot 四足机器人训练四足动作策略，并将其部署到真实机器人中。"

#: source/refs/additional_resources.rst:16
msgid "LLM Generated Reward Functions"
msgstr "LLM 生成的奖励函数"

#: source/refs/additional_resources.rst:18
msgid ""
"Eureka uses an LLM to generate and tune reinforcement-learning reward "
"functions."
msgstr "Eureka 使用大语言模型生成并调优强化学习奖励函数。"

#: source/refs/additional_resources.rst:20
msgid ""
"`Isaac Lab Eureka <https://github.com/isaac-sim/IsaacLabEureka>`_ provides "
"the reward-generation pipeline for direct Isaac Lab environments."
msgstr ""
"`Isaac Lab Eureka <https://github.com/isaac-sim/IsaacLabEureka>`_ 为 Isaac "
"Lab 直接工作流环境提供奖励生成流水线。"

#: source/refs/additional_resources.rst:22
msgid ""
"`Eureka! NVIDIA Research Breakthrough Puts New Spin on Robot Learning "
"<https://blogs.nvidia.com/blog/eureka-robotics-research/>`_ is a blog post "
"that covers the broad idea of this reward generation process."
msgstr ""
"`Eureka! NVIDIA 研究突破为机器人学习带来新气象 <https://blogs.nvidia.com/blog/eureka-"
"robotics-research/>`_ 是一篇涵盖这一奖励生成过程广泛理念的博客文章。"

#: source/refs/additional_resources.rst:26
msgid "Simulation Features"
msgstr "仿真特性"

#: source/refs/additional_resources.rst:28
msgid ""
"The following resources cover Isaac Sim workflows. For Isaac Lab's physics "
"and rendering options, see :doc:`/source/concepts/physics_backends` and "
":doc:`/source/concepts/renderers`."
msgstr ""
"以下资源介绍 Isaac Sim 工作流。Isaac Lab 的物理与渲染选项见 "
":doc:`/source/concepts/physics_backends` 和 "
":doc:`/source/concepts/renderers`。"

#: source/refs/additional_resources.rst:32
msgid ""
"`Simulation Performance Guide "
"<https://docs.omniverse.nvidia.com/kit/docs/omni_physics/latest/dev_guide/guides/physics-"
"performance.html>`_ is a best practice guide for obtaining the best "
"simulation performance from OmniPhysics."
msgstr ""
"`仿真性能指南 "
"<https://docs.omniverse.nvidia.com/kit/docs/omni_physics/latest/dev_guide/guides/physics-"
"performance.html>`_ 是一份关于如何从 OmniPhysics 获得最佳仿真性能的最佳实践指南。"

#: source/refs/additional_resources.rst:34
msgid ""
"`Deploying Policies in Isaac Sim "
"<https://docs.isaacsim.omniverse.nvidia.com/latest/isaac_lab_tutorials/tutorial_policy_deployment.html>`_"
" is an Isaac Sim tutorial on how to use trained policies within the "
"simulation."
msgstr ""
"`在Isaac Sim 中部署策略 "
"<https://docs.isaacsim.omniverse.nvidia.com/latest/isaac_lab_tutorials/tutorial_policy_deployment.html>`_"
" 是一个关于如何在仿真中使用训练策略的 `Isaac Sim` 教程。"

#: source/refs/additional_resources.rst:36
msgid ""
"`Supercharge Robotics Workflows with AI and Simulation Using NVIDIA Isaac "
"Sim 4.0 and NVIDIA Isaac Lab <https://developer.nvidia.com/blog/supercharge-"
"robotics-workflows-with-ai-and-simulation-using-nvidia-isaac-sim-4-0-and-"
"nvidia-isaac-lab/>`_ describes the features introduced in Isaac Sim 4.0."
msgstr ""
"`利用 NVIDIA Isaac Sim 4.0 和 NVIDIA Isaac Lab，通过 AI 与仿真加速机器人工作流 "
"<https://developer.nvidia.com/blog/supercharge-robotics-workflows-with-ai-"
"and-simulation-using-nvidia-isaac-sim-4-0-and-nvidia-isaac-lab/>`_ 介绍 Isaac "
"Sim 4.0 新增功能。"

#: source/refs/additional_resources.rst:38
msgid ""
"`Fast-Track Robot Learning in Simulation Using NVIDIA Isaac Lab "
"<https://developer.nvidia.com/blog/fast-track-robot-learning-in-simulation-"
"using-nvidia-isaac-lab/>`_ introduces Isaac Lab's robot-learning workflows."
msgstr ""
"`使用 NVIDIA Isaac Lab 加快仿真中的机器人学习 <https://developer.nvidia.com/blog/fast-"
"track-robot-learning-in-simulation-using-nvidia-isaac-lab/>`_ 介绍 Isaac Lab "
"的机器人学习工作流。"
